  "src": {
   "type": "file",
   "file": "index.html",
   "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Shell Packager v2.0 - Standalone APK, On Phone</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;background:#e6e9ef;color:#111}\nbody.dark{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff}\n.top{padding:18px;max-width:720px;margin:auto}\nh1{font-size:32px;line-height:1;margin:8px 0}\nh1 span{display:block;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px #111}\nbody.dark h1 span{-webkit-text-stroke:2px #fff}\np{color:#555;line-height:1.6}\nbody.dark p{color:#aab4c5}\n.card{background:#e6e9ef;border-radius:24px;padding:20px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:8px 8px 20px #c3c9d6,-8px -8px 20px #fff}\nbody.dark .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);box-shadow:none}\ninput,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #ccc;font-size:16px;margin:8px 0;background:#fff}\nbody.dark input,body.dark textarea{background:#222;color:#fff;border-color:#444}\nbutton{border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:13px 22px;font-size:16px;margin:6px 6px 6px 0;background:#fff;color:#111;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;box-shadow:4px 4px 12px #c3c9d6,-4px -4px 12px #fff}\nbody.dark button{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff;box-shadow:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}\nbutton.black{background:#111;color:#fff}\nbody.dark button.black{background:#fff;color:#111}\nbutton:disabled{opacity:.5}\n#status{font-weight:600;white-space:pre-wrap}\n.track{width:110px;height:52px;border-radius:30px;background:#fff;box-shadow:inset 3px 3px 8px #c3c9d6;position:relative;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block}\nbody.dark .track{background:#222}\n.knob{position:absolute;top:6px;left:6px;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#111;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:left .3s}\nbody.dark .knob{left:64px;background:#fff;color:#111}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"top\">\n<h1>SHELL PACKAGER v2<br><span>STANDALONE APK, ON PHONE</span></h1>\n<p><b>What this does, simply:</b> It takes this app's own shell, puts your HTML inside it, changes its home-screen name and package to yours, signs it again on the phone with APK Signature Scheme v2, and saves a standalone .apk in Downloads. No GitHub build is needed for that app.</p>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<b>Step 1 - Your HTML</b>\n<input type=\"file\" accept=\".html,.htm\" onchange=\"readFile(this)\">\n<textarea id=\"html\" rows=\"7\" placeholder=\"Paste your HTML here, or choose a file. Try: <h1>Hello</h1><button onclick=&quot;Android.toast('Hello')&quot;>Say Hello</button>\"></textarea>\n<b>Step 2 - App name (this is the name on the home screen)</b>\n<input id=\"appName\" placeholder=\"App name, for example TA SERIES\" value=\"MyApp\">\n<b>Step 3 - Package (optional, leave blank for automatic)</b>\n<input id=\"pkg\" placeholder=\"Leave blank, or type like com.example.myapp\">\n<p style=\"margin:0\">If you leave Step 3 blank, the package is made from your app name, for example TA SERIES becomes com.example.taseries. The file name also comes from your app name.</p>\n<button class=\"black\" id=\"buildBtn\" onclick=\"buildApk()\">\ud83d\udce6 Build Standalone APK</button>\n<button id=\"openBtn\" onclick=\"openApk()\" style=\"display:none\">\u25b6 Open / Install Saved APK</button>\n<p id=\"status\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<b>Please read this first, in v2:</b>\n<p>1. The saved APK now gets your app name on the home screen and your own package. It can be installed on a phone that still has Shell Packager installed, because the package is different.</p>\n<p>2. The icon is still the packager's icon in v2. Only the name and package change, not the icon.</p>\n<p>3. If you type the packager's own package, or leave the app name as Shell Packager with the automatic package, the build will refuse, because that output could not be installed next to Shell Packager.</p>\n<p>4. This v2 renaming has not been tested on a phone yet. If the installer says the package is invalid, tell Muse the exact words, and do not share that file.</p>\n<p>Camera, location, microphone and maps are not in this shell yet, and will not be faked.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<b>Dark / White</b>\n<div class=\"track\" onclick=\"document.body.classList.toggle('dark');document.getElementById('knob').textContent=document.body.classList.contains('dark')?'\u263e':'\u2600'\"><div class=\"knob\" id=\"knob\">\u2600</div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">This changes the packager look only, not your HTML.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\nfunction readFile(el){var r=new FileReader();r.onload=function(){document.getElementById('html').value=r.result};r.readAsText(el.files[0])}\nfunction setStatus(t){document.getElementById('status').textContent=t}\nfunction buildApk(){\n var h=document.getElementById('html').value.trim();\n var a=document.getElementById('appName').value.trim();\n var pk=document.getElementById('pkg').value.trim();\n if(!h){setStatus('Paste or choose HTML first.');return}\n if(!a){setStatus('Type an app name first.');return}\n setStatus('Building... please wait, do not close the app. This can take a few seconds.');\n document.getElementById('buildBtn').disabled=true;\n setTimeout(function(){\n  try{\n   if(!window.Android || !Android.buildStandalone2){setStatus('Error: buildStandalone2 is not available in this app. This HTML must run inside the Shell Packager v2 app, not a browser.');document.getElementById('buildBtn').disabled=false;return}\n   var r=Android.buildStandalone2(h,a,pk);\n   if(r.indexOf('ok|')===0){\n     var parts=r.split('|');\n     setStatus('Done. Saved to: '+parts[1]+'\\nNow tap Open / Install, or find the file in Downloads. In v2 you do NOT need to uninstall Shell Packager first, because the saved app has its own package and home name.');\n     document.getElementById('openBtn').style.display='inline-block';\n   } else {\n     setStatus('Build failed: '+r);\n   }\n  }catch(err){setStatus('Build failed: '+err)}\n  document.getElementById('buildBtn').disabled=false;\n },150);\n}\nfunction openApk(){\n try{\n  var r=Android.openStandalone();\n  setStatus(r==='ok' ? 'Installer should open now. If it asks, allow installing from this source once.' : 'Could not open: '+r);\n }catch(err){setStatus('Could not open: '+err)}\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('load',function(){\n try{var h=localStorage.getItem('packager_html'); if(h) document.getElementById('html').value=h;}catch(e){}\n});\ndocument.getElementById('html').addEventListener('input',function(){\n try{localStorage.setItem('packager_html',document.getElementById('html').value)}catch(e){}\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
  },
